# backslash-text: What does XPPAUT 8.2.2 do with text after a backslash (`\5`)?
# xpp: v@3=3
# pc: ODE0003,ODE0019
# ruling: XPPAUT continues the line and drops the `5`. PhaseCont keeps the stray-character error, since dropping text would change the formula without a word (language.md, Lines).
x'=1+\5
2
x(0)=0
aux v=x
@ total=1,dt=0.5,meth=euler
